WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.144
Make a school-compound sketch with major landmarks.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.414
Landmarks are places or objects that help us recognise locations. On a school sketch,

00:00:09.414 --> 00:00:13.139
show buildings, the gate, play area, library or water point.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.608
Walk around with an adult, notice where the places are relative to one another and

00:00:18.608 --> 00:00:22.334
label them. Use simple lines and symbols to make the map clear.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.723
With permission, walk around the school, then label four safe, familiar landmarks.
